      "text": "output/\n|-- policy/                        (metadata + cuts + convergence)\n|   |-- metadata.json              Policy metadata & state dictionary\n|   |-- cuts/stage_NNN.bin         Binary cut data (FlatBuffers)\n|   |-- convergence.json           Convergence history\n|\n|-- simulation/                    (summary + results)\n|   |-- summary.json               Aggregate statistics\n|   |-- scenario_results.parquet   Detailed results\n|   |-- distributions/             Per-variable distributions\n|\n|-- logs/                          (training.log + performance.json)\n|\n|-- checkpoints/                   (latest -> checkpoint_NNNNNN.bin)",
